{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5","id":1415720,"title":"Brainwashing in V5","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-27T13:01:41-07:00","id":1415720,"title":"Brainwashing in V5","content":"Hi. <br /> <br /> Im thinking about using a vampire antagonist whose modus operandi is brainwashing mortals from a specific population group into believing being enslaved is the right state to be for their people.<br /> <br /> What disciplines could you use to brainwash someone like that, using the V5 rules? Is Dominate enough?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T13:28:03-07:00","id":1415724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5#post1415720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi.<br /> <br /> Im thinking about using a vampire antagonist whose modus operandi is brainwashing mortals from a specific population group into believing being enslaved is the right state to be for their people.<br /> <br /> What disciplines could you use to brainwash someone like that, using the V5 rules? Is Dominate enough?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dominate is about making a person obey, not really changing their opinion. I think that's more Presence.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T14:08:16-07:00","id":1415734,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5?p=1415724#post1415724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dominate is about making a person obey, not really changing their opinion. I think that's more Presence.</div> </div> </div> </div>What about the level 4 power: <i>Rationalize</i> ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","user":"Argonot","date":". 09-27-2020, 05:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T15:00:00-07:00","id":1415741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5#post1415720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi.<br /> <br /> Im thinking about using a vampire antagonist whose modus operandi is brainwashing mortals from a specific population group into believing being enslaved is the right state to be for their people.</div> </div> </div> </div>being enslaved to what? the vampire antagonist?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T15:14:40-07:00","id":1415745,"title":"","content":"Full context:<br /> <br /> The story is set in the 1940s. The antagonist is a nazi Ventrue whose prey exclusion are jews (only takes susteinance from jewish blood). For obvious reasons, he doesnt want to exterminate jews, but knows their &quot;right place in society&quot;...as cattle. He wants to start his own concentration camp full of jewish families which will be his Herd. He wants them to behave (so internal vigilance wouldnt be necessary), and theres no better way of achieving that, that convincing those people of such bullshit...through supernatural means. <br /> <br /> This is meaningful because one of my players is playing a Hermetic jewish woman. I want her to confront the horror of seeing some of her own people repeating nazi rubbish and defending their current state like it was the ultimate truth. I want her Mage party to try to undo that brainwash via Mind magic...if they can save someone after they kill the vampire, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","user":"Argonot","date":". 09-27-2020, 06:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T15:21:01-07:00","id":1415747,"title":"","content":"then blood bond it is, you might need associates if the community you're trying to bond is large<br /> <br /> I'd say dominate 3 - forgettful mind should do as well (plus dominate 5 - mass manipulation if you're targetting a large community),<br /> problem is it's going to be a lengthy and tedious process, since you have to alter alot of memories to affect their attitude,<br /> and it may not be premanent, requiring repeating the process<br /> <br /> it used to be easier in previous editions, since you could interrogate the victim iirc, and delete memories","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 09-27-2020, 06:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T16:07:56-07:00","id":1415753,"title":"","content":"But, can you blood bond people without turning them into ghouls?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T19:01:14-07:00","id":1415770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5?p=1415753#post1415753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But, can you blood bond people without turning them into ghouls?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, you could bond them and then let the ghoul 'wear off' and only give them a 'refresh' on their bond when it's ready to go down a step. But they'd initially be ghouled no matter what, since bonding has to be drunk directly from the vein.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T03:06:54-07:00","id":1415794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5?p=1415753#post1415753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But, can you blood bond people without turning them into ghouls?</div> </div> </div> </div>To create a ghoul you must feed him with a rouse check equivalent of vitae, but there is not stated in the rulebook the amount of vitae to create a blood bond, so I would say that just a couple of drops would be enough. So yes, you can create a blood bond without turning them into ghouls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25915,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25915-nicolai","user":"nicolai","date":".  Typo 09-28-2020, 06:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25915-nicolai","name":"nicolai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T03:08:10-07:00","id":1415795,"title":"","content":"I'd say what you want is old dominate, not v5 dominate<br /> <br /> there was a dominate 4 power called &quot;conditioning&quot; that made the victims into mind slaves that lacked initiative <br /> <br /> problem with it is I don't think it can be undone with magic, <br /> the victim would have to go through some recovery periode after being separated from their tormentor","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T07:38:49-07:00","id":1415826,"title":"","content":"So, - going V5 - &quot;Rationalize&quot; is not useful for that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T09:49:57-07:00","id":1415844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5?p=1415826#post1415826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, - going V5 - &quot;Rationalize&quot; is not useful for that?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Rationalize takes a dominate command and makes them come up with the internal reasons that the thing they did is their own thought. So long-term use of rationalize and dominate commands and forgetful mind to change people could be used as a brainwashing tool. Brainwashing isn't really a 'one and done' kind of situation, even in old editions, as the Conditioning power took lots of time to enact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T10:23:03-07:00","id":1415849,"title":"","content":"maybe instead of a ventrue, you could use a mage with enough mind and life to get a concentration camp and harvest quintessence from the prisonners","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T10:55:01-07:00","id":1415855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5?p=1415849#post1415849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">maybe instead of a ventrue, you could use a mage with enough mind and life to get a concentration camp and harvest quintessence from the prisonners</div> </div> </div> </div>That was my first thought, but they faced a widderslainte witch (who used children as raw materials to make miraculous potions) last time. Another mage antagonist this soon feels kind of...repetitive. Besides, the idea is that killing that vampire will set them in the middle of a storm regarding the local vampire comunity.<br /> <br /> I think I will go with the Blood Bond + Presence formula. Or use Conditioning from V20.<br /> <br /> Thanks, folks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","user":"Argonot","date":". 09-28-2020, 01:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T12:24:29-07:00","id":1416507,"title":"","content":"There's always the obvious: The Forgetful Mind, Level 3 Dominate. It'll take a lot of effort (unless you have Mass Manipulation (and ideally Irresistible Voice)), but it's clearly the best way to brainwash people. Just spend enough time creating memories so that they associate you with a saviour or parent or something, and it's easy. There's no explicit rules for it, but it's pretty clear you could create memories like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26420-desparen","name":"Desparen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T01:37:50-07:00","id":1416958,"title":"","content":"So this is more like a Houserule, no RAW, but i'd go with a Project (Core p.415). To start the Project, you need Dominate 3 forgetfull mind and/or Dominate 4 rationalize, if he has Dominate 5 mass manipulation i'd give him a lower increment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T07:45:06-07:00","id":1416993,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1415720-brainwashing-in-v5?p=1416958#post1416958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So this is more like a Houserule, no RAW, but i'd go with a Project (Core p.415). To start the Project, you need Dominate 3 forgetfull mind and/or Dominate 4 rationalize, if he has Dominate 5 mass manipulation i'd give him a lower increment.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is indeed a house rule, because this is not how project works.<br /> <br /> You need have the risk to lose backgrouunds points to, maybe, after many many hard rolls, and much OFF time, gain TEMPORARY background dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T12:16:29-07:00","id":1417033,"title":"","content":"I think using disciplines for this role in V5 is a mistake. Maybe you could do it with forgetful mind, maybe you could use implanted directive to cause them to do something when they do something you don't want them to do (though i believe recurring directives are verbotten in V5). In prior editions, you'd get by with mesmorize and probably wouldn't even need the power literally called conditioning.. but that ship has been sunk.<br /> <br /> The best way to brainwash in V5 would be... the mundane way.<br /> Lots of resources, lots of propaganda, lots of normal 're-education' in facilities they can't leave. You could blood-bond a few leaders of the community and have them sway the rest to your line of thinking. You reward obedience and punish dissent. You have them spy on eachother. Maybe they'll hate themselves so much they'll think they deserve it. You don't need actual powers when this is something you can do in real life with enough funding. Powers are just there to streamline things. <br /> <br /> Presence in V5 fairs well in helping this approach. It's really strong in this edition, and you're playing a Ventrue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-07T04:13:13-07:00","id":1417129,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24832_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24832\" data-vbnamecard=\"24832\">blailton</a> <br /> Since I was writing from my phone I did not go into detail, but you are right, you have the risk of losing Background points, while on a succsess you can get them temporarily or buy them permanently with XP. <br /> What I was refering to was the launch/Goal roll being the dominate+manipulation roll. You would need to stake influence, ressources and/or allie points for the Project, getting something like a herd.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26305,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","user":"TakeoChan","date":". 10-07-2020, 07:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}